    "CA-R-2508 still requires one outgoing containment and binds it to Header.Container without a duplicate Header.Relations storage.",
    "CA-R-2712 preserves separate current direct-container identity, Plan Active status and present positive Work Sequence Number; single tuple replaces the former disjoint typed storage branches.",
